OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,8,     GBach's Christmas Oratorio with
OL,9,     GStephen Layton conducting his
OL,10,     Gmulti-award-winning choir,
OL,11,     GPolyphony and the Britten
OL,12,     GSinfonia at Saffron Hall.
OL,13,G2145FThe Essay: Accompanying Austen
OL,14,     GAntonia Quirke speaks to
OL,15,     Gcomposers who've scored original
OL,16,     Gmusic for Austen adaptations
OL,17,     Gabout their musical choices and
OL,18,     Galso about the music Austen
OL,19,     Gencountered. Today: Ruth Barrett.
